			Please set the type to one of the available ones, in order to specify, which kind of this series 
			you want to select:
		
			FINDER-30.22.7.vvv or
			FINDER-30.22.7.vvv.x300
			
			where:
			FINDER-30.22.7. is the model series, and
			vvv is the nominal voltage in three digits, one of the values 005 006 009 012 024 048
			the optional ending 300 sets the contacts to be normally open (NO) - without that ending it is changeover(CO).
			
			For example, FINDER-30.22.7.012.x300 is a valid type. But the type given, [modeltype] is not.
			You can find the datasheet with this part description at [datasheet].
		</Dialog>
	ENDIF
</FINDER_32_21>   

